    "description": "This course introduces advanced programming concepts using Python for data science and engineering applications. Students will develop programming skills through the use of Python data structures, user-defined functions, and interactive programming environments such as Jupyter Notebook. The course also covers scientific computing and data analysis libraries including NumPy and Pandas, as well as data visualization techniques using Matplotlib and Seaborn. Through practical exercises and problem-solving activities, students will learn to manipulate, analyze, and visualize data."
  },
